OL,3,GNEWSANo answers a year after fire at
OL,4,Aformer stately home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are still no answers a year after
OL,7,Fa fire destroyed a Grade II-listed
OL,8,Fformer stately and children's home.
OL,10,FAn arson probe was launched after the
OL,11,Ffire at former Shotley Park Residential
OL,12,FCare Home, Shotley Bridge, County
OL,13,FDurham on 5 October 2025.
OL,15,FDurham Police said it carried out a
OL,16,F"thorough investigation" into the
OL,17,Fblaze, but eventually closed the
OL,18,Finvestigation amid "evidential
OL,19,Fdifficulties".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
