OL,3,GNEWSANo answers a year after fire at
OL,4,Aformer stately home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Wright, who lived in the building
OL,7,Fwhen it was a Dr Barnardo's children's
OL,8,Fhome, said a year on he still could not
OL,9,Fbring himself to visit the place where
OL,10,Fhe grew up and his brother's ashes were
OL,11,Fscattered.
